  "type": "page",
  "content": "<a href=\"/\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M257.5 445.1l-22.2 22.2c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0L7 273c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L201.4 44.7c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.2 22.2c9.5 9.5 9.3 25-.4 34.3L136.6 216H424c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24v32c0 13.3-10.7 24-24 24H136.6l120.5 114.8c9.8 9.3 10 24.8.4 34.3z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBack\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<p>Project &gt;</p><p>UMKM Sukatani Website</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>UMKM Sukatani Website</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p data-path-to-node=\"7\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Project Overview: </b>UMKM Sukatani is a community-driven platform designed to digitize the local business ecosystem in Taman Kuliner Sukatani, Depok. The platform serves as a centralized bridge connecting local vendors with residents and visitors, fostering economic growth through digital visibility.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"9\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Challenge (Problem): </b>Local small businesses (UMKM) struggled with online exposure. While they needed a digital presence, most community managers were not tech-savvy. The biggest hurdle was the complexity of maintaining a website; the standard WordPress dashboard was too intimidating and risky for non-technical users to manage daily.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"11\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Solution: </b>I architected a system that prioritizes <b data-path-to-node=\"12,0\" data-index-in-node=\"40\">Ease of Use</b> and <b data-path-to-node=\"12,0\" data-index-in-node=\"56\">Sustainability</b>:</p><ul data-path-to-node=\"12,1\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Front-End Admin System:</b> I built a simplified dashboard on the front end. Local managers can add new vendors, update menus, or post news via simple forms without ever seeing the complex WordPress backend.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Content Architecture:</b> Utilized <b data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"31\">Custom Post Types (CPT)</b> to separate Business Listings from Community News, ensuring the database remains organized as the platform grows.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Hyper-Local UX:</b> Designed a mobile-first interface, acknowledging that most local users access information via smartphones.</p></li></ul>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🔗Live Site</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://tamankulinersukatani.com/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLink\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"a1627aa\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"30\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTgwNSwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMTFcLzMwLnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImExNjI3YWEifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/30.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/30.png\" alt=\"30\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"a1627aa\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"31\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTgwNiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMTFcLzMxLnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImExNjI3YWEifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/31.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/31.png\" alt=\"31\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"a1627aa\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"32\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTgwNywidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMTFcLzMyLnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImExNjI3YWEifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/32.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/32.png\" alt=\"32\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"a1627aa\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"33\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTgwOCwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMTFcLzMzLnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImExNjI3YWEifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/33.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/33.png\" alt=\"33\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"a1627aa\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"galeri1\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTgzOCwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMTFcL2dhbGVyaTEucG5nIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiYTE2MjdhYSJ9\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/galeri1.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/galeri1.png\" alt=\"galeri1\" /></figure></a>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 442C296 454 292 471 292 487 292 504 296 521 308 533L604 854C617 867 629 875 646 875 663 875 679 871 692 858 704 846 713 829 713 812 713 796 708 779 692 767L438 487 692 225C700 217 708 204 708 187 708 171 704 154 692 142 675 129 663 125 646 125Z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M696 533C708 521 713 504 713 487 713 471 708 454 696 446L400 146C388 133 375 125 354 125 338 125 325 129 313 142 300 154 292 171 292 187 292 204 296 221 308 233L563 492 304 771C292 783 288 800 288 817 288 833 296 850 308 863 321 871 338 875 354 875 371 875 388 867 400 854L696 533Z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p data-path-to-node=\"13\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Result: </b>A scalable, self-sustaining platform where the community has full control over their content. This reduces dependency on technical support and empowers local businesses to manage their digital presence independently.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🧩 <strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"407\">Topic Area</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLocal UMKM\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCommunity Platform\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBusiness Directory\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDigital Empowerment\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🛠️ <strong data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"961\">Skills Used</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWordPress CMS + Elementor Pro\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tCustom Post Type (UMKM &amp; News) 83%\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tFront-End Admin System 81%\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tResponsive Web Design\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tContent Architecture\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>⭐ Key Features</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<ul><li data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1870\"><p data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1870\"><strong data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1795\">UMKM Directory:</strong> Browse businesses with photos, menus, descriptions, and contact details.</p></li><li data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1971\"><p data-start=\"1873\" data-end=\"1971\"><strong data-start=\"1873\" data-end=\"1899\">Front-End Admin Panel:</strong> Add, edit, and manage UMKM data and news without technical knowledge.</p></li><li data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"2055\"><p data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2055\"><strong data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2001\">Community News Section:</strong> Publish updates and activities for local residents.</p></li><li data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2155\"><p data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2155\"><strong data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2082\">Clean Visual Layout:</strong> A modern, accessible interface optimized for mobile and desktop users.</p></li></ul>"
}